# Every text file checks out with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf
# says: unit files, maintainer scripts, sources and docs are consumed on Unix,
# and tests read them as text (ADR-0158). Git still detects binaries itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# Windows-only scripts are the one exception.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
